  <p class="cv-summary">
    Country and economic research analyst specializing in Vietnam and Southeast Asia. Four
    years living and running a consultancy in Hà Nội; advanced Vietnamese (speak, read, write);
    working Bahasa Indonesia. Graduate training in ASEAN studies (SOAS, Distinction) and
    development economics (City, University of London, Distinction). Core competencies: market
    and regulatory-environment research, econometric analysis, and policy- and
    investment-relevant reporting for public- and private-sector clients.
  </p>

